<section>
  <h2>Direct Transfer to a Real Robot</h2>
  <p>
    Training data was collected in MuJoCo with noisy joint torque and base force/torque measurements. The model was then evaluated on a Kinova Gen3
    with an ATI Mini85 base sensor. Each contact condition was tested 100 times, changing the robot configuration every 20 trials.
  </p>
  <div class="research-content__table-wrap" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="CDM real-world contact localization results">
